flowchart TB
  entry[OS setup entry / platform and mode validation] --> mac[Mac prerequisites / backup / bootstrap]
  entry --> linux[Linux role / prerequisites / runner / SSH / enrollment]
  entry --> windows[Windows prerequisites / transcript / setup file lock]
  mac --> posix[Config then install links]
  linux --> posix
  windows --> winconfig[Normalize reporter config / manual-only links and config]
  posix --> daily[OS daily 02:00 registration]
  winconfig --> daily
  daily --> update[Existing agents-update / public product setup / finalize]
  update --> receipt[Fresh report ID and batch / delivery receipt]
  receipt --> verify[Inventory and verify-install]
  verify --> done[Setup result / Windows setup receipt]
  done -- Windows manual only --> smoke[Start daily task / bounded fresh receipt smoke]
  smoke --> accepted[Scheduled receipt observed]
  mac -. failure .-> held
  linux -. failure .-> held[Completed earlier steps retained / no global rollback]
  windows -. failure .-> held
  update -. failure or unknown .-> held
  optional[Explicit 1Password setup only] --> package[Install / protocol / register]
  package --> auth[CLI and optional desktop authentication]
  auth -- ready --> ready[exit 0]
  auth -- waiting --> waiting[JSON / exit 3 / installed state retained]
  package -. failure .-> held
